msgstr ""

#: includes/class-simple-redis-cache-admin.php:787
msgid "Set Cache eligibility to Eligible for cache and Edge TTL to \"Use cache-control header if present, bypass cache if not\". This lets the plugin decide what the edge may store: it sends s-maxage only on an anonymous cache hit, never on a miss, a bypass or a logged-in request."
